 faq=[('What is AlphaCode?','AlphaCode (also written Alpha Code) is a free, open-source AI coding agent written in Rust that runs in your terminal. It reads your project, edits files and runs tests.'),('Do I need an API key or to pay?','No. The free AI provider is configured automatically after install. Later you can use Claude, GPT, Gemini or a local model through Ollama.'),('Is it the same as the Alpha Coders wallpaper site?','No. Alpha Coders and Wallpaper Abyss is an unrelated wallpaper website. AlphaCode is a developer tool and is not affiliated with it.')],
